{"parse": {"title": "旧金山小子-06", "pageid": 60895, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%90-05\" title=\"旧金山小子-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">旧金山小子-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%90-07\" title=\"旧金山小子-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">旧金山小子</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.A4.E5.AE.B6.E8.B7.AF.E7.AA.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冤家路窄\">冤家路窄</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 冤家路窄</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Me Again</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2060106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"beilinkejie2122haocheku\"><img alt=\"beilinkejie2122haocheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/600px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/900px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png/1200px-Cg-beilinkejie2122haocheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>霍利克拿得起这根棍子，但会不会太显眼了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离约定的时间已经过去了小半个钟头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管工坊主人对老伙计的迟到早就习以为常，但今天，他心中却有了种不太妙的预感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这把小刀留给贝克特。好姑娘，今晚上你最好别见血，祝愿咱们能把事儿和平解决了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>该来的伙计没等来，不该来的电话铃声倒是闯进了工坊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你好，这儿是J。你哪位？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>坏消息，J，昨晚你离开之后，安东尼带人来了餐馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安东尼，一个糟糕的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我昨天在迪厅里还逮着那混球，在西海岸之星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-309613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-309613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-309613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>或许是在你之前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>贝克特先生和霍利克先生跟着安东尼的人去了街口，他们可能吵了一架，但那之后他俩就没回餐馆了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>刚才有街上的伙计过来，说看到他俩被带到西海岸之星去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>西海岸之星？什么时候？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>昨晚，但具体不清楚。我们联系不上你，所以现在才……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我昨晚就在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>好吧，这事儿先不说了。我去一趟。店里没事吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>除了少了俩伙计，其他人都很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>解决掉麻烦后我就回来。回见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铸剑师傅一边披上外衣，一边拨通电话——打给另一位朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>布莱克汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>好消息，我搞到帮派那伙人的消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但坏消息是我得先去迪厅把两个老伙计捞出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他瞄了眼猫头鹰挂钟，留给他的时间可算不上富余。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>下午三点，布莱克汉，约个地方见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-611401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-611401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-611401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>老鼠大道的电话亭，乔治老爷开的糖果铺对面那个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>行，详细的等碰头再说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挂断电话，火急火燎地冲出工坊——做头儿的，总免不了为自己的倒霉伙计“擦屁股”。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迪厅小子：</div><div>J！这个点店里还没开门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我找曼妮有急事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个谎言，撒谎的时候脸不红心不跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迪厅小子：</div><div>白天都不许放客人进店里的，J，不过你嘛，只要别闹大动静……我没看见你来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迪厅小子，机灵小子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我是趁着尽职尽责的小塔夫不注意的时候，自己偷摸溜进店里的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>对了，我的好伙计安东尼回来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迪厅小子：</div><div>他昨晚回来之后就没再出去了，现在应该在地下室，听说昨天弄了两个家伙进去关着，天晓得是在哪招惹了帮派的倒霉鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地下室？很好。旧金山小子迈着大步，从守门人眼皮子底下潜入了昨夜的“巴克斯神庙”……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帮派打手：</div><div>哪个部门的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>安东尼老大叫我来看看你们有没有偷懒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帮派打手：</div><div>那混蛋哪来的胆子？他**的就是老板收的一条狗，也配来盯着咱们干没干活？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-501601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帮派打手：</div><div>你去跟他说，有胆儿的就自己出来当着老子的面摆谱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你敢这么跟我说话？哈！你小子等着，等着，我这就去找他，你完了，伙计，你完了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场拙劣的演出，男主角强忍着笑意，朝地上啐口唾沫，大摇大摆地走向地下室……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你等着，听见没，等着——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这响声却引起了看门恶犬的注意，嗯，一条……一条醉醺醺的恶犬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒打手：</div><div>什……什么动静？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你就是这儿的看门狗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒打手：</div><div>看……看门……狗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒打手：</div><div>再、再说一句试试！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>搞定一个醉鬼，只需要照着他鼻子来上一拳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>少喝两杯，伙计，大白天的喝醉酒可不像话。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>说真的，听我一句劝，你是个聪明人，贝克特，你只要点头，我保证你可以——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>我说了没我的招呼，谁也不准进来，听不明白是不——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听不明白是不是？——但很可惜，闯进地下室的不速之客并不打算听他的命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一回是钥匙，而不是皮靴或一把大剑踹开了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>J！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>J、J？！怎么又是你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>是啊，怎么又是我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>怎么总是我呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叛徒正想开口叫人，却被逮住机会的贝克特一击头槌砸了个狠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-625012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-625012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-625012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>啧啊……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>借着这空挡，J几步上前，拎起叛徒的衣领，把那混球当待宰的兔子一样提着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东尼：</div><div>大、大哥！大哥！你念念好，我以前可是帮过咱们不少忙啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你兜里好东西不少嘛，安东尼，现在是我的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一叠请柬，为某些想混进晚宴蹭上一顿酒食的朋友们而准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>姗姗来迟的J把叛徒扔到一旁，踩住他脖子，解开两个老伙计的束缚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而绳子总会找到新的“宿主”——叛徒得到了应有的下场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这儿没别的路出去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J环顾四周，在狭窄的地下车库里找寻着出路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在堆积起的废弃轮胎后面，他踢开了一道长满铁锈的旧门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>地下室里还有个地下室？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>不，J，这儿看起来……通下水道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>下水道也是条路，咱们就走这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>这家伙怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>捂住嘴，绑起来，扔进垃圾桶。倒着扔，垃圾就该待在桶里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xiashuidao\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xiashuidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>我好像踩到了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你最好踩到的是会动的东西，会动的多半是老鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>那不会动的是啥？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是一个J不大愿意说出口的词，常常堆积在下水道的污垢中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>伙计，咱们待会儿还要去体面的地方赴宴，别坏胃口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈，你就当是死老鼠吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但不得不说，伙计们，我突然觉得——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>生活就像在下水道里跳舞，咱们永远也不知道脚边还会漂过点什么东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一条断掉的丝巾，一束枯萎的玫瑰，又或者是空空荡荡的啤酒瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在深不见底的黑暗中，只有老伙计能凭着早些年讨生活的经验找到出路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>往左边，大哥，左边，那儿该有个上去的梯子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>要是没被拆走的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>谁会把下水道里的破烂玩意儿偷走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摸到一块锈迹斑斑的铁架，湿冷的金属传来呜咽。J听得见，这是金属的声音——只有他能听见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你在这待了多久了，朋友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>J，你刚才在跟我俩说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嗯？不，没有。我走第一个，贝克特跟上，霍利克，你压在我俩后头，稳住梯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>你别急，等我俩顺着先上去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>该死的，这底下真臭……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">后街伙计：</div><div>噢！下水道里钻出个人！等等，一个、两个……三个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>搭把手，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他刚从井道里探出脑袋，一股难以忍受的恶臭便冲进鼻孔，险些熏得他缩回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>多谢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>喂，霍利克，你小子怎么不说这出口旁边就是……呃……是垃圾堆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">后街伙计：</div><div>朋友们，垃圾堆里宝贝多着呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我宁愿回底下去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">后街伙计：</div><div>你喜欢和耗子过夜吗，朋友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不喜欢。乔治老爷的糖果铺在哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">后街伙计：</div><div>巷子口左拐，他们家的太妃糖是海特街顶好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>去找个干净点的地方待待，然后冲个澡，到唐老爹餐馆去，给他们看这个——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>然后你就能吃一顿饱饭，祝你愉快，当心别被警察逮住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J亲手把一枚铮亮的金属徽章别在新朋友的旧衬衣上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-561901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">后街伙计：</div><div>这玩意儿是啥？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-625612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-625612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-625612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>一个证明：现在你是J的朋友了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>贝克特，快跟上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>别弄丢它，记住，如果你有朋友也需要它，告诉他们，来唐老爹餐馆找J。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>……你这一身味儿怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>刚钻了耗子洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那伙人背后是都板街的帮派，靠一个叫R的代理人和某些人物有勾结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他们今晚会在银门饭店碰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>银门饭店……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警长对这个名字感到迟疑。那儿似乎已经超出了他强壮的臂膀能伸及的范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>消息可靠吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>除非安东尼是个不怕死的好汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这儿，警长放声大笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>哈哈哈，好，带上这个，小心点说话，它什么都听得见，也记得住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>窃听器？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我们叫它“虫子”，窃听虫，警局配发的神秘学小玩意儿，比一般的录音工具好使。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>你们怎么计划的？别告诉我你打算提着刀冲进去，然后找到东西再一路砍出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>贝克特和霍利克会拿着请柬进去，他们俩在一楼惹事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>让最会惹事的人干他们最擅长干的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>而我会找机会溜上楼，偷到证据。你在晚上八点的时候带人到饭店来，记者，警察……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>要是你失手了怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J指指身旁两位兄弟。如果失手了，那就带走他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他们俩也不是头一回吃你那儿的牢饭了，到时候只能劳烦你多照顾照顾我的老伙计了，布莱克汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>嗯，两个在饭店闹事的小流氓，一场盛大的都板街晚宴，警车和聚光灯出现在这样的地方并不奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>对了，还有个坏消息：如果你搞不定这件事，那后天早上我就必须把局子里关着的那些人送给相关部门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>换句话说，J，你的那些朋友可能得被遣返，或者扔去墨西哥的哪个沙漠里做苦工，看他们自己选。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默片刻后，J没对布莱克汉的这番话做出回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我答应过伙计们要给他们一条活路，别担心，布莱克汉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我不想为难你，但规矩就是这样，我尽力了，上下都有压力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>今晚八点整，最好早点到，我搞到证据就出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>在金的首饰店门口碰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>伙计们，收拾收拾，咱们也该出发了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>都板街往那边走，J，你搞反了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>换身干净行头！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "旧金山小子-06"}}